__hash__":262},"content_en\u002F1.getting-started\u002F8.troubleshooting\u002Finstallation-issues.md","Database and Installation Troubleshooting",{"type":204,"value":205,"toc":246},"minimark",[206,210,215,225,229,232,243],[207,208,202],"h2",{"id":209},"database-and-installation-troubleshooting",[211,212,214],"h3",{"id":213},"_1-database-migrations-failing-due-to-foreign-key-collations-not-matching","1. Database Migrations Failing Due to Foreign Key Collations Not Matching",[216,217,218,219,224],"p",{},"This issue occurs when the collation of your database, tables, or columns is inconsistent. To resolve this, ensure that the collation is consistent across all tables. Refer to the ",[220,221,223],"a",{"href":222},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Freference\u002Fdatabase-setup","Database Setup"," documentation for detailed guidance on checking and updating collations.",[211,226,228],{"id":227},"_2-database-dsn-collation-parameter-incorrect","2. Database DSN Collation Parameter Incorrect",[216,230,231],{},"When configuring your database connection string (DSN), ensure that the collation parameter matches the server's collation. For example:",[233,234,240],"pre",{"className":235,"code":237,"language":238,"meta":239},[236],"language-text","DB_USER:DB_PASS@tcp(DB_HOST:DB_PORT)\u002FDB_NAME?collation=utf8mb4_unicode_ci&loc=Europe%2FBerlin\n","text","",[241,242,237],"code",{"__ignoreMap":239},[216,244,245],{},"If the server uses a different collation than the DSN, this mismatch can cause issues. Update the DSN to use the collation configured for the database and tables.",{"title":239,"searchDepth":247,"depth":247,"links":248},2,[249],{"id":209,"depth":247,"text":202,"children":250},[251,253],{"id":213,"depth":252,"text":214},3,{"id":227,"depth":252,"text":228},"Troubleshooting common installation issues related to database configuration and migrations.","md",null,{},true,"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftroubleshooting\u002Finstallation-issues",{"title":202,"description":254},"1.getting-started\u002F8.troubleshooting\u002Finstallation-issues","CNdeV_pf4dDdSWV2ZDau1ekS6yNM8n4cirCMN-PzRgU",[264,269],{"title":265,"path":266,"stem":267,"description":268,"children":-1},"Troubleshooting","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftroubleshooting","1.getting-started\u002F8.troubleshooting\u002Findex","Diagnose common FiveNet installation and database problems.",{"title":270,"path":271,"stem":272,"description":273,"children":-1},"User Guides","\u002Fuser-guides","3.user-guides\u002F0.index","This section contains practical guides for FiveNet features, including setup notes, workflows, and usage tips.",1789078706562]